# Build output — regenerated by `build.mjs` (`prepare` / `prepack` run it).
/lib/

# Promotional media: the README screenshots. Kept on disk because the README
# renders them, but this repo is a private self-use fork and does not carry its
# upstream's marketing surface in version control.
#
# `assets/` held the two button icons as white-backed PNGs, base64-inlined into
# `lib/client.js`. They were replaced by inline SVG (see `iconSvg` in
# src/client.src.js): the bitmaps had an opaque white ground, so dark mode could
# only reach them through `filter: invert(1)`, which turned the ground black and
# left the 1080px source visibly soft at 18px. Nothing reads `assets/` now.
/docs/images/

# Local packaging artifacts
*.tgz
